            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Schafkopf is the Bavarian four-player point-trick game with Obers, Unters, and Hearts as trumps. In the common Rufer contract the declarer calls an Ace to choose a secret partner.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Country/Region of Origin: Europe\nTime Period: Early 1900s\nHistorical Development: The game evolved from traditional card games in the region\nCultural Significance: Popular social and family game',
